    "chunk_text": "steorran & eallum tidum, gelicere w\u00e6gan mid leohte On \u00f0am feor\u00f0an d\u00e6ge gesceop God twa miccle leoht, \u00fe\u00e6t is sunne & mona; & bet\u00e6hte \u00fe\u00e6t mare On \u00f0am ylcan d\u00e6ge he geworhte ealle steorran, & tida gesette. On \u00f0am fiftan d\u00e6ge he gesceop eal wyrmcynn, & \u00f0a micclan hwalas & eal fisccynn, on mislicum & On \u00f0am sixtan d\u00e6ge he gesceop eal deorcynn, & ealle nytenu \u00fee on feower fotum ga\u00f0, & \u00fea twegen On \u00f0am seofo\u00f0an d\u00e6ge he geendode his weorc & seo wucu w\u00e6s \u00f0a agan. Nu is \u00e6lc d\u00e6g on \u00f0isum middanearde of \u00f0\u00e6re sunnan lihtinge. So\u00f0lice seo sunne g\u00e6\u00f0 be Godes dihte betwux heofenan & eor\u00f0an, on d\u00e6g bufon eor\u00f0an & on niht \u00c6fre heo bi\u00f0 yrnende ymbe \u00f0as eor\u00f0an, & eal swa leohte scin\u00f0 under \u00f0\u00e6re eor\u00f0an on nihtlicere tide, On \u00f0a healfe \u00f0e heo scin\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00f0 d\u00e6g, & on \u00f0a healfe \u00f0e heo ne scin\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00f0 niht. \u00c6fre bi\u00f0 on sumere sidan \u00fe\u00e6re eor\u00f0an d\u00e6g, & \u00e6fre on sumere sidan niht. \u00de\u00e6t leoht \u00f0e we hata\u00f0 d\u00e6gered, cym\u00f0 of \u00f0\u00e6re sunnan \u00feonne heo upweard bi\u00f0; & heo \u00f0onne todr\u00e6f\u00f0 Eal swa \u00f0icce is seo heofen mid steorrum afylled on d\u00e6g swa on niht, ac hi nabba\u00f0 nane l",
